! NTP, SNMPv3, Syslog - time sync + secure monitoring + audit trail
!
! SNMPv3 with auth+priv (not the v2c community strings). NTP keeps
! logs/certs reliable. Syslog ships everything to the collector.
!
! --- Time ---
ntp server 203.0.113.10
ntp source Loopback0
ntp authenticate
ntp authentication-key 1 md5 NtpKey01
ntp trusted-key 1

! --- SNMPv3 (user with auth + encryption) ---
snmp-server group MONRO v3 priv
snmp-server user monuser MONRO v3 auth sha MonUserAuth01 priv aes 256 MonUserPriv01
snmp-server host 10.10.0.50 version 3 priv monuser
snmp-server location DC-CORE
snmp-server contact netadmin

! --- Syslog ---
logging host 10.10.0.51
logging trap informational
logging source-interface Loopback0
logging buffered 32000 informational
service sequence-numbers
service timestamps debug datetime msec
service timestamps log datetime msec

! Verify
! show ntp status
! show snmp user
! show logging
